  <!--
    Base (English) UI strings for Pikura.

    Add a key here first, then add the same key to Strings.ja.resx / Strings.zh.resx /
    Strings.ko.resx. Anything missing from a translated file falls back to this file, so a partially
    translated language is safe to ship.

    Reference a key from XAML with the Tr markup extension:
        xmlns:loc="using:Pikura.Avalonia.Localization"
        <TextBlock Text="{loc:Tr Common_Cancel}"/>

    Naming: Area_Thing (Settings_Title, Collage_AddToCollage, Common_Cancel).
